<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "The conversation is printed like continuous printer paper, the kind with green and white stripes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_nicklist}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "One Name Above Several Lines")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "When one person writes several messages in a row, their name and the hour appear once, above the first message. The messages under it share the same stripe. A new stripe starts when someone else speaks, after five minutes of silence, or on a new day."
  )}
</p>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Point at a message, or reach it with the keyboard, to see the hour it was written. Your own messages are printed on a light blue stripe."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_clock}>{dgettext("help_features", "Where a Day Starts")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A dotted perforation with the date marks the first message of each day. Each message shows only the hour and minute. Point at the hour to see the full date."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_status_user}>{dgettext("help_features", "Notices From the Room")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Some messages come from the room rather than from a person: /me actions, System, Service and Error messages, and deleted messages. They have no stripe and appear between the stripes, each with a small icon."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_features", "Pictures and Emoji")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A message with only one to three emoji is printed large. Pictures appear without a frame; point at one to see its file name and size, and click it to open it."
  )}
</p>
